title: "EFP wheat fibre GWAS analysis code"
type: software
version: "1.0.3"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AKAlabdullah/EFP_WE-AX_GWAS"
authors:
  - family-names: "Alabdullah"
    given-names: "Abdul Kader"
    affiliation: "John Innes Centre"
abstract: >-
  R analysis code for the Elite Fibre Panel study of water-extractable
  arabinoxylan in bread wheat, including phenotype analysis, SNP quality
  control, GWAS, allele effects, linkage disequilibrium and expression figures.
keywords:
  - wheat
  - arabinoxylan
  - GWAS
  - linkage disequilibrium
  - reproducible research